{
  "description": "Golden scenarios for the chase-decision task. Each gives an invoice summary (as produced by src/paypal.js invoiceSummary) and optional payer history, and expects an action and, for remind, a tone. The heuristic ladder is the reference; the SLM must match it on action and tone while drafting better copy.",
